  "question": {
    "text": "A transformer consisting of <math><mn>300</mn></math> turns in the primary and <math><mn>150</mn></math> turns in the secondary gives output power of <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> . If the current in the secondary coil is <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> , then the input voltage and current in the primary coil are:"
  },
